                <pb facs="0988" n="946" sameAs="frus:frus1964-68v27/pg946"/>

                <head>Errata</head>
                <p>The following error has been identified in <ref target="frus:frus1964-68v27">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1964–1968, Volume
                        XXVII</ref>, Mainland Southeast Asia; Regional Affairs. Please be aware that
                    printed volumes have not been revised. <!--Revised information is in italic.-->
                </p>
                <list type="simple">
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">1. Document 368 (date of errata entry: January 3,
                            2013)</hi>
                    </item>
                    <item>The volume skips from <ref target="#d367">Document 367</ref> to <ref
                            target="#d369">369</ref> (see <ref target="#pg818">pages 818</ref>–<ref
                            target="#pg819">19</ref>).</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
